Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The proof rebuilds to `#Top`, but an unconstrained `gpaEqFour` oracle enables the false result `3.9 → A+`. The arbitrary-length theorem also uses a proof-only list representation unconnected to real program lists.

